      "sourceTextSha256": "562e5b594657e1246f569617da7f93020c8287a4bc8bc295789f8d921cf78577",
      "text": "An early transfer takes you to the pier at 05:30. From there, take a speedboat to Santa Cruz Island. The crossing takes around 2½ hours.\n\nOn arrival, you transfer to the airport with a driver only. The drive takes around one hour. Your flight to the mainland must depart after 12:00 noon.\n\nAt Baltra Airport, check in for your flight to Quito or Guayaquil. The recommended minimum connection time is four hours.\n\n**Meals:** breakfast.",
